+/// left foot (X+3) on the $10 tile of column 84 and the right foot (X+12) on the $11 tile of column 85, i.e.
+/// X in [1348, 1356]: x_pos >= 0x54400 (the WR enters at X 1348).
+#[allow(dead_code)]
