+  // ---- Options::BlockStates (P2.3b-2): block objects, VRAM_Buffer1 occupancy and the area-parser schedule ----
+  /// NMI part: interval timers (IntervalTimerControl wraps 0 -> 20 and ticks BrickCoinTimer), FrameCounter, and the
+  /// VRAM buffer flush: VRAM_Buffer1 is transferred and cleared unless VRAM_Buffer_AddrCtrl was 6 (then it is left
