+  /// 13 frames after the bump, i.e. from the frame on which BlockBounceTimer reads 2 — if VRAM_Buffer1 is free),
+  /// ColorRotation (palette write every 8th frame), then UpdScrollVar / the area parser (F78: a burst of 8 tasks per
+  /// 32 px of scroll; RenderAreaGraphics / RenderAttributeTables set VRAM_Buffer_AddrCtrl = 6; AreaParserCore on a
+  /// coin brick's column clears BrickCoinTimerFlag; paused on frames with AddrCtrl already 6).
